'''Instant feats''' are [[feat]]s that need to be activated to use, but that take effect instantly. Unlike most feats, instant feats bypass the [[action queue]] and lack an activation animation.

Instant feats were added in [[patch]] 1.66, but no official content made use of these until patch 1.69, at which point the following instant feats were added to the game:
[[rallying cry]],
[[heroic shield]],
[[oath of wrath]],
[[horse menu]] (and all sub-options),
[[DM tool]]s, and
[[player tool]]s.

== Custom content notes ==

* A feat is specified as being an instant feat if its "ReqAction" column in <code>[[feat.2da]]</code> is 0.
